msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Osnovna podešenja"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Podrazumevani jezik galerije"

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanje baze"

msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Administratorska podešenja"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Pokreni instalaciju"

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Bice prikazano posetiocima. Neophodno je za administraciju stranice"

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Konekcija na server uspešna, ali konecija na bazu je nemoguca"

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Nemoguce povezivanje na server"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Host"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Korisnik"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "korisnicko ime dat od strane Vašeg host distributera"

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr "korisnicka lozinka data od strane Vašeg host distributera "

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Ime baze"

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "takode dato od Vašeg Host distributera"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Prefix tabele baze"

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "ime tabele baze will bice prefix sa njim (omogucava da upravljate bolje Vašuim tabelama)"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "Unesi pristupne podatke za webmaster"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "pristupni podaci za webmastera ne mogu sadržati znake ' ili \""

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "molim unesite Vašu lozinku ponovo"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Sacuvajte u tajnosti, omogucava pristup administratorskom delu"

msgid "Password [confirm]"
msgstr "Lozinka[potvrdi]"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "Provera"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Potrebna Vam je pomoc? Pitajte na  <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo tabli za poruke</a>."

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Posetioci ce biti u mogucnosti da koriste ovaj mail da kontaktiraju administratora stranice"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "PHP 5.2 je neophodan"

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Izgleda da Vaš webhost trenutno koristi PHP %s."

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo može pokušati da promeni Vašu konfiguraciju na PHP 5.2 kreiranjem ili menjanjem .htaccess datoteke."

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Imajte u vidu da možete sami izmeniti Vašu konfiguraciju restartovati Piwigo posle toga."

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Pokušajte da podestite PHP 5.2"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Žao nam je!"

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo wnije uspeo da podesi PHP 5.2"

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Trebalo bi da se obartite podršci Vašeg hosting provajdera za uputstvo kako da promenite na PHP 5.2 sami."

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Nadamo se da se uskoro vidimo."

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Cestitamo, Piwigo instalacija je završena"

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr "Alternativno rešenje je da kopirate tekst iz kutije iznad i nalepite u datoteku \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Upozorenje : database.inc.php mora sadržati samo tekst iz kutije, bez linije ili praznih karaktera)"

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Kreiranje konfiguracione datoteke local/config/database.inc.php neuspešno."

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Snimi na racunar konfiguracionu datoteku"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Možete snimiti na racunar konfiguracionu datoteku i poslati je na local/config direktorijum Vaše instalacije."

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Ne oklevajte da zatražite pomoć na našem forumu oko bilo čega: %s"

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "Još jedna Piwigo galerija"

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Dobrodošli u moju foto galeriju"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli na Vašu novu instalaciju Piwigo-a!"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "localhost ili drugi naziv koji ste dobili od provajdera"

